Z||000000||olympic||07-25-2000||12:53 AM||||  I recently upgraded to a newer version of Netscape Communicator and was having problems with my browser accepting or recognizing site certificates.  If anyone else has this problem, the solution can be found here.  <A HREF="http://help.netscape.com/kb/consumer/19981210-12.html" TARGET=_blank>http://help.netscape.com/kb/consumer/19981210-12.html</A> <P>Hope some finds this useful.<P>------------------<BR>Your best...???  Losers whine about doing their best.   Winners go home and f*** the prom queen! - Sean Connery in "The Rock"||||reg||1
